{%- comment -%}
  Address. Outputs an address as lines joined by <br>, skipping blank
  company and address2. Capture it and pass it as a detail value.
  Built from fields on purpose: Shopify's format_address wraps its output in
  its own <p>, which breaks out of the surrounding styles in Gmail.
  Input, reset after use:
    address  a Shopify address
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- address.name }}<br>
{%- if address.company != blank %}{{ address.company }}<br>{% endif -%}
{{- address.address1 }}<br>
{%- if address.address2 != blank %}{{ address.address2 }}<br>{% endif -%}
{{- address.city }} {{ address.province_code }} {{ address.zip }}<br>
{{- address.country -}}
{%- assign address = nil -%}
